OL,3,GNEWSAArrests as pupil hurt and reports
OL,4,Acar drove at teacher
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been arrested after
OL,7,Freports a car was driven towards a
OL,8,Fteacher outside a school in Warwick.
OL,10,FWarwickshire Police were called at
OL,11,F08:30 BST and told the occupants of a
OL,12,Fblack Ford Puma made threats towards
OL,13,Fpupils at a school on Shelley Avenue
OL,14,Fand then left the area.
OL,16,FThe force believe they have located the
OL,17,Fdriver and they have been arrested and
OL,18,Fa young teenager was also reportedly
OL,19,Fassaulted resulting in a cut to their
OL,20,Fface.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
