OL,3,GNEWSAArrests as pupil hurt and reports
OL,4,Acar drove at teacher
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old girl from Warwick was
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of assault - ABH
OL,8,Fwhile a 46-year-old man from Nottingham
OL,9,Fand a 43-year-old woman from Warwick
OL,10,Fwere both arrested on suspicion of
OL,11,Fattempted assault - GBH. All three have
OL,12,Fbeen released on bail.
